      "id": "timeline_clarity",
      "label": "Timeline Clarity",
      "score": 2,
      "strengths": "A concrete overall duration is stated for delivering the proposed implementation.",
      "weaknesses": "Section §3 gives a single 8-week duration without defining intermediate milestones, phase breakdowns, or the required 3-month pilot.",
      "citations": [
        {
          "source": "proposal",
